  "title": "Balanced summer snacking and meal prep - The Campbell's Company",
  "summary": "Do your eating habits change as the temperature rises? As the summer heat arrives, you may find your appetite decreases. It may be more of a snacking, mini meal season for you and your family. You may also prefer to spend less time in the kitchen in favor of being outside. Here we share some snacking and meal prep solutions to maximize nutrition when you want smaller meals and less structured […]",
